  <button id="send-proposal" type="button" class="send-button" disabled>
    Send to Cody
  </button>

  <p class="form-note">
    Pick a tier and a Tailwater option above, then type both your names. Send routes a confirmation to you both and a notification to Cody. Formal contracts and the first invoice follow within the week.
