</div>

<footer>
Cody Smith, Cody A Smith LLC. <a href="mailto:cody@codyasmith.com">cody@codyasmith.com</a>. <a href="https://codyasmith.com">codyasmith.com</a>. Prepared May 22, 2026 for Jason Roth and Kevin Adams.
